[h1]Changes:[/h1]

- Fixed and updated PBR materials for characters and environments;
- Qualitatively changed the visual effects of locations;
- The modified system of ambient sounds works physically correctly;
- Lots of animations for the main character, NPCs and enemies have been redesigned to make them smoother;

[h1]Improvements:[/h1]

- Added dragon fire ignition system (works on opponents, wooden objects and in some context events);
- The general state of the locations has been visually improved - the quality of textures and materials has been improved, a lot of "objects of interest" have been added.


[b]A new type of weapon is in the process of being finalized - double top spear[/b]

